'==================== 西里尔字母 页 按钮事件 ====================
'左键：把按钮上的字符模拟键盘输入到“当前焦点窗口”
Sub Form5_YFbutton1_WM_LButtonUp(ControlIndex As Long, hWndForm As hWnd, MouseFlags As Long, xPos As Long, yPos As Long)
   InsertSymbol Form5.YFbutton1(ControlIndex).Caption
End Sub

'右键：把按钮上的字符复制到剪贴板
Sub Form5_YFbutton1_WM_RButtonUp(ControlIndex As Long, hWndForm As hWnd, MouseFlags As Long, xPos As Long, yPos As Long)
   CopySymbol Form5.YFbutton1(ControlIndex).Caption
End Sub

'西里尔字母 页中部分字符不在 GBK 代码页内，自动生成时会变成“?”，这里在运行时用 WChr 补正
